{"event":"reply","n":1,"text":"Key details: split lines on spaces only (other characters 32–126 only, so no tabs). Words are split by the space character. Validate fields in order. Rounding is half away from zero, done on the absolute value, with the sign put back.\n\nRounding division: round(a/b) for a ≥ 0 is (2a + b) / (2b), which stays in i64 range because the values are below 10^14.\n\nValidation:\n- Name: 1–20 characters from [A-Za-z0-9_-].\n- Quantity: optional `-`, then 1–3 digits.\n- Price: 1–5 digits, `.`, then 2 digits.\n- Discount: 1–3 digits then `%`, value ≤ 100.\n- Tax: 1–2 digits, `.`, 2 digits, `%`.\n\nThe last line may lack a line feed. Splitting on '\\n' leaves a trailing empty piece when the file ends with a newline, which is blank and skipped, so line numbers stay correct.\n\nFormatting: sign, then abs/100, then '.', then abs%100 as two digits. For the total line: if the sum is ≥ 0 print `total`, otherwise `refund` with the absolute value.\n\n```rust\nuse std::fs;\n\nfn rdiv(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 {\n    let s = if a < 0 { -1 } else { 1 };\n    let x = a.abs();\n    s * ((2 * x + b) / (2 * b))\n}\n\nfn fmt(c: i64) -> String {\n    let a = c.abs();\n    format!(\"{}{}.{:02}\", if c < 0 { \"-\" } else { \"\" }, a / 100, a % 100)\n}\n\nfn digits(s: &str, lo: usize, hi: usize) -> bool {\n    s.len() >= lo && s.len() <= hi && s.bytes().all(|b| b.is_ascii_digit())\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let path = std::env::args().nth(1).unwrap();\n    let data = fs::read(&path).unwrap();\n    let text: String = data.iter().map(|&b| b as char).collect();\n    let mut out = String::new();\n    let mut sn = 0i64;\n    let mut st = 0i64;\n    let mut stot = 0i64;\n    let mut count = 0;\n    for (i, line) in text.split('\\n').enumerate() {\n        let n = i + 1;\n        let w: Vec<&str> = line.split(' ').filter(|x| !x.is_empty()).collect();\n        if w.is_empty() {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let err = |m: &str| -> ! {\n            println!(\"error: line {}: {}\", n, m);\n            std::process::exit(20);\n        };\n        if w.len() != 5 {\n            println!(\"error: line {}: expected 5 fields, got {}\", n, w.len());\n            std::process::exit(20);\n        }\n        let name = w[0];\n        if !(name.len() >= 1\n            && name.len() <= 20\n            && name\n                .bytes()\n                .all(|b| b.is_ascii_alphanumeric() || b == b'_' || b == b'-'))\n        {\n            err(\"bad name\");\n        }\n        let q = w[1];\n        let (neg, qd) = if let Some(r) = q.strip_prefix('-') { (true, r) } else { (false, q) };\n        if !digits(qd, 1, 3) {\n            err(\"bad quantity\");\n        }\n        let mut qty: i64 = qd.parse().unwrap();\n        if neg {\n            qty = -qty;\n        }\n        let p = w[2];\n        let pb = p.as_bytes();\n        if !(p.len() >= 4 && p.len() <= 8 && pb[p.len() - 3] == b'.' && digits(&p[..p.len() - 3], 1, 5) && digits(&p[p.len() - 2..], 2, 2)) {\n            err(\"bad price\");\n        }\n        let price: i64 = format!(\"{}{}\", &p[..p.len() - 3], &p[p.len() - 2..]).parse().unwrap();\n        let d = w[3];\n        if !(d.ends_with('%') && digits(&d[..d.len() - 1], 1, 3)) {\n            err(\"bad discount\");\n        }\n        let disc: i64 = d[..d.len() - 1].parse().unwrap();\n        if disc > 100 {\n            err(\"bad discount\");\n        }\n        let t = w[4];\n        let tb = t.as_bytes();\n        if !(t.ends_with('%') && t.len() >= 6 && t.len() <= 7 && tb[t.len() - 4] == b'.' && digits(&t[..t.len() - 4], 1, 2) && digits(&t[t.len() - 3..t.len() - 1], 2, 2)) {\n            err(\"bad tax\");\n        }\n        let rate: i64 = format!(\"{}{}\", &t[..t.len() - 4], &t[t.len() - 3..t.len() - 1]).parse().unwrap();\n        count += 1;\n        let gross = qty * price;\n        let dc = rdiv(gross * disc, 100);\n        let net = gross - dc;\n        let tax = rdiv(net * rate, 10000);\n        let total = net + tax;\n        sn += net;\n        st += tax;\n        stot += total;\n        out.push_str(&format!(\n            \"{}: gross {} discount {} net {} tax {} total {}\\n\",\n            name,\n            fmt(gross),\n            fmt(dc),\n            fmt(net),\n            fmt(tax),\n            fmt(total)\n        ));\n    }\n    if count == 0 {\n        println!(\"error: no items\");\n        std::process::exit(20);\n    }\n    out.push_str(&format!(\"net {}\\n\", fmt(sn)));\n    out.push_str(&format!(\"tax {}\\n\", fmt(st)));\n    if stot >= 0 {\n        out.push_str(&format!(\"total {}\\n\", fmt(stot)));\n    } else {\n        out.push_str(&format!(\"refund {}\\n\", fmt(-stot)));\n    }\n    print!(\"{}\", out);\n}\n```","input":2716,"output":2001,"cut_off":false,"ms":11768,"at":1791999628559}
